  "releaseNotes": "Adds support for Umbraco 18. This release runs on Umbraco 17.5.3 and later, including Umbraco 18.x, from the same package.\n\nUpgrading from 17.0.x: update the package reference. Settings and picked assets are kept, and no configuration changes are needed.\n\nTo insert IntelligenceBank videos and audio as playable media in the rich text editor, enable the \"IB Media (Video/Audio)\" capability on the Rich Text Editor data type. Without it they are inserted as links.",
